			"notes": "ClaudeCraft 1.2.2 for Minecraft 1.21.1 — **NeoForge**\n\nThis release ports the 1.21.1 build from Forge to **NeoForge**. The previous 1.21.1 jars were built for Forge, but ClaudeCraft's required dependency — CC: Tweaked — ships as a **NeoForge** mod on 1.21.1, so the old Forge jars could never load. This build runs on NeoForge.\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.21.1\n- NeoForge 21.1.0+ (built and tested against 21.1.234)\n- [CC: Tweaked](https://modrinth.com/mod/cc-tweaked) 1.117.1+\n\n### Install\nDrop `claudecraft-1.2.2-mc1.21.1.jar` into your `mods/` folder, alongside CC: Tweaked, on a **NeoForge** 1.21.1 instance.\n\n### Changes\n- Build migrated from ForgeGradle to ModDevGradle (NeoForge 21.1.x).\n- `META-INF/mods.toml` → `META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml` (now depends on `neoforge`).\n- Mod sources ported from `net.minecraftforge.*` to `net.neoforged.*` (FML constructor, `NeoForge.EVENT_BUS`, `@EventBusSubscriber`, `ModConfigSpec`, `BuiltInRegistries`).\n\nVerified with a clean Gradle build and a NeoForge dedicated-server boot with the mod loaded against CC: Tweaked.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)"
		},
